96
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,840
The blue channel will hang at the input.

97
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,580
Plus-minus.

98
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:52,280
Look — actually the system input is supplied with DC.

99
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:55,200
