148
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:30,420
Touch plus — doesn't light.

149
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:39,220
Touch the output — doesn't light, because here's DC, no pulses — already DC on this cap.

150
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:42,000
Now look what happens on the heat sinks.

151
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:48,520
By the way, the transistors are isolated from the heat sinks, but the heat sinks are also part of the suction zone in this effect.

152
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:52,520
Touch — look, the neon glows.

153
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:55,400
And on the bifilar leads — here.

154
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:59,140
It's everywhere on the bifilars.

155
00:10:59,900 --> 00:11:02,240
This effect is on each one.

156
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:09,560
This is what BD didn't show — at his place this thing glows.

157
00:11:11,260 --> 00:11:17,580
And on the common — where we connect — no glow, it goes to the cap.

158
00:11:18,460 --> 00:11:28,420
