159
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:36,960
turn it off, pull it out — these pulses come after the diodes.

160
00:11:37,140 --> 00:11:41,640
Naturally, the cap doesn't smooth it here, so the effect is present.

161
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:45,300
The phenomenon is different.

162
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:50,460
No need to invent back EMF and the rest.

163
00:11:50,580 --> 00:11:57,980
Real radio amateurs have already done a lot of experiments and written it off.

164
00:11:59,380 --> 00:12:01,380
I talked with them about this.

165
00:12:02,300 --> 00:12:05,080
And no one saw your flybacks in this scheme.

166
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,120
The effect is different.

167
00:12:06,860 --> 00:12:15,780
Moreover — look carefully where you saw back EMF, where it works — where did you ever see back EMF with such width?

168
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:19,640
